        <dc:creator>251402069 - Farel Yamotaro Hia
251402004 - Yabesh Day Siahaan
251402046 - Ray Nathan Geereno Saragih
251402052 - William Fransisco Sihotang
251402128 - Naufal Muhammad Dzaki</dc:creator>
        <dc:description xml:lang="en">We Modeling 360 Medan traditional dishes, 71 venues &amp; branches, named WGS84 GPS coordinates, all 21 official Medan districts and 151 official kelurahan, 15 culinary hubs, 50 ingredients, 12 cultural heritages, and 10 cooking techniques.</dc:description>
        <owl:versionInfo>4.6.0</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


